%% distributed-cache set/get sequence
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant P as Primary
  participant R1 as Replica 1
  participant R2 as Replica 2
  C->>P: SET k v ttl
  P->>P: store
  P-->>R1: replicate (async)
  P-->>R2: replicate (async)
  P-->>C: OK (policy met)
  C->>P: GET k
  P-->>C: v
